{"synopsis":"Behenti di sana Jenderal besar\nThe Omniscient Master Penasihat Kaisar dan guru para Penjaga kekaisaran Dia memiliki jalan untuk diikuti meski itu berarti membuang titlenya sebagai yang terkuat dalam sejarah\nDia berjalan seperti terpukul angin Tampangnya yang tua dan rambutnya yang putih tidak terlihat lagi Yang terlihat hanyalah pemuda dengan rambut hitam yang menjuntai\nNamaku Lee Gwol\nAku tidak akan terbatas Akan kujelajahi dunia layaknya angin Aroma teh akan membersihkan dunia yang berdarah\nThe Unbending Ruler Kesaksian jalan dari Sang Jenderal Besar Lee Gwol","alternative_title":"Captain of the Royal Guard-Daeyeong-bahn","author":"Booksam","artist":"Baek Ho","chapters":[{"chapter_id":"a914b705-1c07-470a-9323-e182801f5997","number":"115","chapter":"115","title":"Chapter 115","date":"2024-11-25","released":"2024-11-25","images":[]},{"chapter_id":"18cb82e5-d2d4-4d56-b5d6-4738527fcd4a","number":"114","chapter":"114","title":"Chapter 114","date":"2024-11-25","released":"2024-11-25","images":[]},{"chapter_id":"8b17c148-4928-420f-9845-88e01073bb51","number":"113","chapter":"113","title":"Chapter 113","date":"2024-11-25","released":"2024-11-25","images":[]},{"chapter_id":"721c8b7b-4306-445f-a1cc-2c7b3ceba549","number":"112","chapter":"112","title":"Chapter 112","date":"2024-11-25","released":"2024-11-25","images":[]},{"chapter_id":"65534692-bf58-4d06-917b-fed3dd47bd8d","number":"111","chapter":"111","title":"Chapter 111","date":"2024-11-25","released":"2024-11-25","images":[]},{"chapter_id":"8ea35965-191c-4f9d-9397-9492240f812a","number":"110","chapter":"110","title":"Chapter 110","date":"2024-11-25","released":"2024-11-25","images":[]},{"chapter_id":"b97aec47-fab0-4c99-96a5-e93cfad9e3b1","number":"109","chapter":"109","title":"Chapter 109","date":"2024-11-25","released":"2024-11-25","images":[]},{"chapter_id":"69c3a6c1-d66f-413a-92e0-f2b06ede7fd1","number":"108","chapter":"108","title":"Chapter 108","date":"2024-11-25","released":"2024-11-25","images":